2                       iField
-1                      iSpecies
0                       profile
8.904640e+03            amplitude
1.445834e+00            frequency
2.105600e+06            waveLength
5.971940                phase
-1.00000000             dir
0.00000000              dir
0.00000000              dir
0.00000000              pol
0.00000000              pol
1.00000000              pol
0                       tStart
